prepare.cpp contains an independently implemented streaming SHA-256, IEEE-754
conversion and safetensors/GGUF container writer. It embeds no model weights,
vocabulary, codec, or training statistics. contract.hpp embeds only structural
metadata from third_party/ltx098-source-lock.json.

The build uses the already pinned nlohmann/json header (MIT), whose original
notices remain in the repository's third-party notices. This component does not
use Python, PyTorch, external executables, network access, or inference APIs.
